 "limits": "Evidence: KuaiRand-Pure (27,285 anonymised Kuaishou users chosen by the KuaiRand authors (China, 2022); interactions only with the 7,583 videos of the random-exposure pool); sessions reconstructed from logged exposures with a 30-minute gap rule (2022-04-22..05-08). The simulator may draw each individual's propensity to start extra sessions on an active day from the fitted Gamma distribution (heterogeneity across individuals) and update it from observed behaviour with the posterior mean. It may NOT infer the absolute number of app sessions: only sessions that contain a logged pool-video exposure are seen, so true session counts are higher; nor session behaviour on other platforms, periods or populations. The gamma-Poisson form assumes a stable individual rate over two weeks.",
